      <p class="ar-meta">
        <span>By <strong rel="author">YAUUM Sourcing Team</strong></span>
        <span>Published <time datetime="2026-10-15">October 15, 2026</time></span>
      <span class="ar-views" data-views-for="/china-apparel-manufacturing-costs-ppi-2026/" data-views-hit></span>
      </p>
      <p class="ar-lede">China's raw-material PPI is up 9.4% year on year while clothing factory-gate prices fell 1.2%. Here is how the latest releases and exchange-traded fiber benchmarks translate into budgets, negotiation anchors, and order timing</p>
